WEBVTT

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:30.776
His face changed.

00:09:30.800 --> 00:09:33.536
"Aw, I thought Prince was coming."

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:36.696
(Laughter)

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:38.656
He had grown up on this block,

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:40.736
and so you could imagine
when he drove past

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:45.656
and saw one of its last remaining houses
mysteriously change colors overnight,

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:48.736
it was clearly not
a Crown Royal bag involved,

00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:51.376
it was a secret beacon from Prince.

00:09:51.400 --> 00:09:53.240
(Laughter)

00:09:55.320 --> 00:10:00.096
And though that block
was almost all but erased,